{"id":"torrey:love-of-christ-the","source":"torrey","name":"Love Of Christ, The","slug":"love-of-christ-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"To the Father — Ps 91:14; Joh 14:31.","refs":[["Ps",91,14,91,14],["John",14,31,14,31]]},{"text":"To his church — Song 4:8,9; 5:1; Joh 15:9; Eph 5:24.","refs":[["Song",4,8,4,8],["Song",4,9,4,9],["Song",5,1,5,1],["John",15,9,15,9],["Eph",5,24,5,24]]},{"text":"To those who love him — Pr 8:17; Joh 14:21.","refs":[["Prov",8,17,8,17],["John",14,21,14,21]]},{"text":"Coming to seek the lost. — Lu 19:10.","refs":[["Luke",19,10,19,10]]},{"text":"Praying for his enemies. — Lu 23:34.","refs":[["Luke",23,34,23,34]]},{"text":"Giving himself for us. — Ga 2:20.","refs":[["Gal",2,20,2,20]]},{"text":"Dying for us. — Joh 15:13; 1Jo 3:16.","refs":[["John",15,13,15,13],["1John",3,16,3,16]]},{"text":"Washing away our sins. — Re 1:5.","refs":[["Rev",1,5,1,5]]},{"text":"Interceding for us. — Heb 7:25; 9:24.","refs":[["Heb",7,25,7,25],["Heb",9,24,9,24]]},{"text":"Sending the Spirit. — Ps 68:18; Joh 16:7.","refs":[["Ps",68,18,68,18],["John",16,7,16,7]]},{"text":"Rebukes and chastisements. — Re 3:19.","refs":[["Rev",3,19,3,19]]},{"text":"Passes knowledge — Eph 3:19.","refs":[["Eph",3,19,3,19]]},{"text":"To be imitated — Joh 13:34; 15:12; Eph 5:2; 1Jo 3:16.","refs":[["John",13,34,13,34],["John",15,12,15,12],["Eph",5,2,5,2],["1John",3,16,3,16]]},{"text":"Unquenchable. — Song 8:7.","refs":[["Song",8,7,8,7]]},{"text":"Constraining. — 2Co 5:14.","refs":[["2Cor",5,14,5,14]]},{"text":"Unchangeable. — Joh 13:1.","refs":[["John",13,1,13,1]]},{"text":"Indissoluble. — Ro 8:35.","refs":[["Rom",8,35,8,35]]},{"text":"Obedient saints abide in — Joh 15:10.","refs":[["John",15,10,15,10]]},{"text":"Saints obtain victory through — Ro 8:37.","refs":[["Rom",8,37,8,37]]},{"text":"Is the banner over his saints — Song 2:4.","refs":[["Song",2,4,2,4]]},{"text":"Is the ground of his saints love to him — Lu 7:47.","refs":[["Luke",7,47,7,47]]},{"text":"To saints, shall be acknowledge even by enemies — Re 3:9.","refs":[["Rev",3,9,3,9]]},{"text":"Illustrated — Mt 18:11-13.","refs":[["Matt",18,11,18,13]]},{"text":"Peter. — Lu 22:32,61.","refs":[["Luke",22,32,22,32],["Luke",22,61,22,61]]},{"text":"Lazarus, &c. — Joh 11:5,36.","refs":[["John",11,5,11,5],["John",11,36,11,36]]},{"text":"His apostles. — Joh 13:1,34.","refs":[["John",13,1,13,1],["John",13,34,13,34]]},{"text":"John. — Joh 13:23.","refs":[["John",13,23,13,23]]}],"refCount":42}
